  "description": "R29 (level-2 arbitration, the release form \u2014 avoidance yields the heading to the reflex), from a1v2_r28_l2_arbitrated.json: the heading reference is a slow regulator and cannot avoid a wall at walking speed (no side response at 0.5-4 s, R28 probe); when avoidance wins it now RELEASES the heading reference so the proximity priors act unopposed. n=6: steady arena walls 44/min (R28 71, R27 9), moved wall after-phase 149/min (R27 253) with half of R27's re-exploration"
